@felan-ai/ext-subagents implements Felan's portable subagent protocol.

Its design was informed by the MIT-licensed pi-subagents project at
https://github.com/mslavov/pi-extensions, reviewed at commit
7e72e509fe45a5a87c4c2e176cb711de994a8c1d. No source code was copied.

This package uses TypeBox 1.1.38 from
